<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="/img/logo.jpeg">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; 
            background-color: #f0fdf4; 
            position: relative;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        .bg-gradient-spot {
            position: absolute;
            z-index: -1;
            width: 700px;
            height: 700px;
            filter: blur(120px);
            opacity: 0.35;
            border-radius: 100%;
        }
        .spot-1 {
            top: -150px;
            right: -100px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, #10b981, #34d399);
        }
        .spot-2 {
            bottom: -200px;
            left: -150px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, #6ee7b7, #a7f3d0);
        }
        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col">

    <div class="bg-gradient-spot spot-1"></div>
    <div class="bg-gradient-spot spot-2"></div>

    <header class="w-full p-6 flex justify-between items-center max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="w-[52px] h-[52px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/20 shadow-xl shadow-emerald-500/20 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-110 active:scale-90">
                <img src="/img/logo.jpeg" alt="Logo" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
            </div>
            <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-800 tracking-tight">
                Vocabulary <span class="text-emerald-600">Checklist</span>
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="hidden md:block">
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">Нет аккаунта?</span>
            <a href="/register" class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 ml-1 transition-colors">Зарегистрироваться</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center p-6">
        <div class="w-full max-w-6xl grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
            
            <div class="hidden md:block space-y-8">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-50/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full border border-emerald-100 shadow-sm">
                    <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>
                    <span class="text-emerald-600 text-sm font-black tracking-wide uppercase">Добро пожаловать</span>
                </div>

                <h1 class="text-6xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-[1.05] tracking-tight">
                    Войдите в свой <br>
                    <span class="text-emerald-600 underline decoration-emerald-200 underline-offset-[12px]">личный кабинет</span>
                </h1>
                
                <p class="text-xl text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
                    Ваш личный сад иностранных слов требует ухода. Заходите, чтобы продолжить прогресс.
                </p>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-5">
                    <div class="glass-card p-5 rounded-[32px] flex items-center gap-4 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-emerald-900/5 active:scale-95 cursor-pointer">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-100/80 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600">
                            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 leading-tight">Персональные <br> подборки</span>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="glass-card p-5 rounded-[32px] flex items-center gap-4 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-emerald-900/5 active:scale-95 cursor-pointer">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-100/80 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600">
                            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 leading-tight">Отслеживание <br> прогресса</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex justify-center md:justify-end">
                <div class="w-full max-w-[440px] bg-white p-12 rounded-[56px] shadow-[0_32px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] border border-slate-100 transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-[0_40px_100px_rgba(0,0,0,0.09)] active:scale-[0.99]">
                    <div class="mb-10 text-center md:text-left">
                        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Вход в аккаунт</h2>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 font-medium mt-2">Введите ваши данные</p>
                    </div>

                    <form action="/login" method="POST" class="space-y-6">
                        <div class="group">
                            <label class="block text-[11px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-3 ml-1">Email или логин</label>
                            <div class="relative">
                                <span class="absolute left-5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-300 group-focus-within:text-emerald-500 transition-colors">
                                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
                                </span>
                                <input type="email" name="email" required 
                                    class="w-full pl-14 pr-6 py-5 bg-slate-50 border-2 border-transparent rounded-[24px] focus:bg-white focus:border-emerald-600/10 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-emerald-600/5 transition-all outline-none font-semibold text-slate-700" 
                                    placeholder="name@company.com">
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <div class="flex justify-between mb-3 ml-1">
                                <label class="text-[11px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Пароль</label>
                                <a href="#" class="text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors"></a>
                            </div>
                            <input type="password" name="password" required 
                                class="w-full px-6 py-5 bg-slate-50 border-2 border-transparent rounded-[24px] focus:bg-white focus:border-emerald-600/10 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-emerald-600/5 transition-all outline-none font-semibold text-slate-700" 
                                placeholder="••••••••">
                        </div>

                        <button type="submit" 
                                class="w-full bg-[#064e3b] hover:bg-emerald-950 text-white py-5 rounded-[24px] font-black text-lg transition-all active:scale-[0.96] shadow-2xl shadow-emerald-900/10 mt-4 uppercase tracking-widest">
                            Войти в систему
                        </button>
                    </form>

                    <div class="mt-10 text-center md:hidden pt-8 border-t border-slate-50">
                        <p class="text-slate-400 font-semibold text-sm">
                            Нет аккаунта? <a href="/register" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline font-bold transition-all active:opacity-70">Создать сейчас</a>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </main>

</body>
</html>